#: scenes/grading/coin_grade.gd
msgid "%s (cleaned)"
msgstr "%s (limpiada)"

#: scenes/grading/coin_grade.gd
msgid "%s's coin had been cleaned and you missed it. It's %s."
msgstr "La moneda de %s estaba limpiada y no lo viste. Es %s."

#: scenes/grading/coin_grade.gd
msgid "%s? Really? I don't think you know coins."
msgstr "%s? ¿En serio? No creo que sepa de monedas."

#: scenes/grading/coin_grade.gd
msgid "A rub on the high points. Half the lustre left: the cartwheel is broken."
msgstr "Roce en los puntos altos. Queda medio brillo: la rueda de luz está rota."

#: scenes/grading/coin_grade.gd
msgid "About Uncirculated"
msgstr "Casi sin circular"

#: scenes/grading/coin_grade.gd
msgid "About half the detail left. Wide smooth plateaus on the design."
msgstr "Queda la mitad del detalle. Mesetas lisas y anchas en el diseño."

#: scenes/grading/coin_grade.gd
msgid "All the detail, light wear on the very top. A little lustre near the letters."
msgstr "Todo el detalle, desgaste leve en lo más alto. Algo de brillo junto a las letras."

#: scenes/grading/coin_grade.gd
msgid "Arthur Bell"
msgstr "Arthur Bell"

#: scenes/grading/coin_grade.gd
msgid "Before I send it off to be slabbed, what's your grade?"
msgstr "Antes de mandarla a encapsular, ¿qué grado le pone?"

#: scenes/grading/coin_grade.gd
msgid "Bought it at an estate sale. I think it's a beauty."
msgstr "La compré en una venta de herencia. Creo que es una belleza."

#: scenes/grading/coin_grade.gd
msgid "Choice About Unc."
msgstr "Casi SC, selecta"

#: scenes/grading/coin_grade.gd
msgid "Cleaned? It has never touched a cloth. I'll take it elsewhere."
msgstr "¿Limpiada? Nunca ha tocado un trapo. Me la llevo a otro sitio."

#: scenes/grading/coin_grade.gd
msgid "Close enough for me. Thank you."
msgstr "Me basta. Gracias."

#: scenes/grading/coin_grade.gd
msgid "Collectors start bringing old coins to be graded. Read the wear, the lustre and the bag marks: a right grade earns a fee and a good word."
msgstr "Los coleccionistas traen monedas antiguas para graduar. Lee el desgaste, el brillo y las marcas de saca: un grado correcto trae honorarios y buena fama."

#: scenes/grading/coin_grade.gd
msgid "Extremely Fine"
msgstr "Extrafina"

#: scenes/grading/coin_grade.gd
msgid "Fine"
msgstr "Bien conservada"

#: scenes/grading/coin_grade.gd
msgid "Gem Mint State"
msgstr "SC gema"

#: scenes/grading/coin_grade.gd
msgid "Good"
msgstr "Regular"

#: scenes/grading/coin_grade.gd
msgid "Graded %s's coin %s, but it's %s. No fee."
msgstr "Graduaste la moneda de %s como %s, pero es %s. Sin honorarios."

#: scenes/grading/coin_grade.gd
msgid "Graded %s's coin %s, but it's %s. They left grumbling."
msgstr "Graduaste la moneda de %s como %s, pero es %s. Se fue refunfuñando."

#: scenes/grading/coin_grade.gd
msgid "Graded %s's coin %s, spot on. Fee and tip %s."
msgstr "Graduaste la moneda de %s como %s, exacto. Honorarios y propina %s."

#: scenes/grading/coin_grade.gd
msgid "Graded %s's coin %s; it's %s. Fee %s."
msgstr "Graduaste la moneda de %s como %s; es %s. Honorarios %s."

#: scenes/grading/coin_grade.gd
msgid "Grading lamp and loupe"
msgstr "Lámpara y lupa de graduar"

#: scenes/grading/coin_grade.gd
msgid "Hm. That's not what I'd have said."
msgstr "Hm. Yo no habría dicho eso."

#: scenes/grading/coin_grade.gd
msgid "I've had this since I was a boy. What grade is it?"
msgstr "La tengo desde niño. ¿Qué grado tiene?"

#: scenes/grading/coin_grade.gd
msgid "Lena Fox"
msgstr "Lena Fox"

#: scenes/grading/coin_grade.gd
msgid "Letters and rim all there. The design is worn flat, no detail inside it."
msgstr "Letras y canto completos. El diseño está gastado y plano, sin detalle."

#: scenes/grading/coin_grade.gd
msgid "Mint State"
msgstr "Sin circular"

#: scenes/grading/coin_grade.gd
msgid "Most of the detail left. The high points are flat and dull."
msgstr "Queda casi todo el detalle. Los puntos altos están planos y apagados."

#: scenes/grading/coin_grade.gd
msgid "No wear at all. Lots of bag marks: count 9 or more."
msgstr "Sin desgaste. Muchas marcas de saca: 9 o más."

#: scenes/grading/coin_grade.gd
msgid "No wear, full lustre, a few bag marks: 4 to 6."
msgstr "Sin desgaste, brillo pleno, pocas marcas de saca: de 4 a 6."

#: scenes/grading/coin_grade.gd
msgid "No wear, full lustre, a mark at most. A gem."
msgstr "Sin desgaste, brillo pleno, una marca como mucho. Una joya."

#: scenes/grading/coin_grade.gd
msgid "Rim worn into the letters. The design is a flat outline."
msgstr "Canto gastado hasta las letras. El diseño es un contorno plano."

#: scenes/grading/coin_grade.gd
msgid "Settle an argument with my brother: what grade?"
msgstr "Zanje una discusión con mi hermano: ¿qué grado?"

#: scenes/grading/coin_grade.gd
msgid "Spot on. You've got the eye. Here, keep the change."
msgstr "Exacto. Tiene buen ojo. Tenga, quédese el cambio."

#: scenes/grading/coin_grade.gd
msgid "Superb Gem"
msgstr "SC gema superior"

#: scenes/grading/coin_grade.gd
msgid "The grading service says it's been cleaned. You didn't see the hairlines?"
msgstr "El servicio de graduación dice que está limpiada. ¿No vio las rayitas?"

#: scenes/grading/coin_grade.gd
msgid "The slightest rub on the very top. The cartwheel only breaks there."
msgstr "El más leve roce en lo más alto. La rueda de luz solo se rompe ahí."

