msgid "Adding to my stack."
msgstr "Para ampliar mi montón."

#: scenes/shop/customer.gd
msgid "Big Earl"
msgstr "Big Earl"

#: scenes/shop/customer.gd
msgid "Bought it years ago. Time to sell."
msgstr "Lo compré hace años. Toca vender."

#: scenes/shop/customer.gd
msgid "Bought them online, need cash fast."
msgstr "Las compré por internet, necesito efectivo ya."

#: scenes/shop/customer.gd
msgid "Bro. %d%%. I'm literally losing money here."
msgstr "Bro. %d%%. Estoy perdiendo dinero, literal."

#: scenes/shop/customer.gd
msgid "Cleaning out the jewellery box."
msgstr "Estoy vaciando el joyero."

#: scenes/shop/customer.gd
msgid "Clearing out my late husband's collection."
msgstr "Vacío la colección de mi difunto marido."

#: scenes/shop/customer.gd
msgid "Come on. %d%% and we shake on it."
msgstr "Venga. %d%% y cerramos el trato."

#: scenes/shop/customer.gd
msgid "Comes with the card, but I lost it."
msgstr "Viene con certificado, pero lo perdí."

#: scenes/shop/customer.gd
msgid "Crypto burned me. I want something real."
msgstr "El cripto me quemó. Quiero algo real."

#: scenes/shop/customer.gd
msgid "Dale"
msgstr "Dale"

#: scenes/shop/customer.gd
msgid "Divorce. Don't ask."
msgstr "Divorcio. No pregunte."

#: scenes/shop/customer.gd
msgid "Fine, fine. Ring it up."
msgstr "Vale, vale. Cóbrelo."

#: scenes/shop/customer.gd
msgid "Found it at an estate sale. It's stamped."
msgstr "Lo encontré en una subasta de herencia. Tiene contraste."

#: scenes/shop/customer.gd
msgid "Found these in a drawer. Real deal, trust me."
msgstr "Las encontré en un cajón. Auténticas, créame."

#: scenes/shop/customer.gd
msgid "Got it cheap from a guy. Real, I promise."
msgstr "Me las dio barato un tipo. Auténticas, lo juro."

#: scenes/shop/customer.gd
msgid "Grandpa Joe"
msgstr "Grandpa Joe"

#: scenes/shop/customer.gd
msgid "Had it appraised for twice that, honest."
msgstr "Me lo tasaron en el doble, en serio."

#: scenes/shop/customer.gd
msgid "How about %d%%? Meet me halfway."
msgstr "¿Qué tal %d%%? Quedemos a medias."

#: scenes/shop/customer.gd
msgid "I could stretch to %d%% over. Deal?"
msgstr "Podría estirarme a %d%% más. ¿Trato?"

#: scenes/shop/customer.gd
msgid "I pay well for quality, but not that well. %d%% over."
msgstr "Pago bien por calidad, pero no tanto. %d%% más."

#: scenes/shop/customer.gd
msgid "Inherited this bar. I'd rather have cash."
msgstr "Heredé este lingote. Prefiero el efectivo."

#: scenes/shop/customer.gd
msgid "It's been sitting in my safe deposit box."
msgstr "Estaba en mi caja de seguridad."

#: scenes/shop/customer.gd
msgid "June"
msgstr "June"

#: scenes/shop/customer.gd
msgid "Kevin"
msgstr "Kevin"

#: scenes/shop/customer.gd
msgid "Look, I'd take %d%% of what it's worth. That's fair."
msgstr "Mire, aceptaría el %d%% de lo que vale. Es justo."

#: scenes/shop/customer.gd
msgid "Marco"
msgstr "Marco"

